{"c":[{"name":"20260919T175827Z-8c1a94d022e0b4f9","text":"2026-09-19 hackathon: GSD and happy-path only; ship, do not polish; preflight must not block on niceties","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T180736Z-4ff972dc89772e30","text":"Mac CI (macos-15) defaults to Xcode 16.4; #available is runtime-only and still type-checks. Keep the Xcode 26 select in ci.yml and #if compiler-gate new SDK APIs.","type":"note"}]}
